{"final":{"answer":"The net change in Entergy Mississippi, Inc. net revenue during 2003 was an increase of $46.4 million (2003 net revenue of $426.6 million minus 2002 net revenue of $380.2 million).","value":46.4,"unit":"USD_million","sources":["source:t4c1n0","source:t1c1n0"],"result_id":"tool:1"}}